  "description": "The VooPoo Argus P3 Pod Vape Kit delivers a powerful blend of high performance and intuitive user customisation, making it a compelling choice for vapers who demand precise control and all-day endurance. Powered by a built-in 1500mAh battery, the Argus P3 provides up to 30W of output, capable of sustaining extended vaping sessions and recharging quickly via USB-C fast charging. Its standout feature is the large, full-colour 2.01-inch TFT touchscreen display, which offers true touch control over your settings. Driven by the intelligent GENE AI chipset, the device features multiple modes, including Smart Mode (which automatically selects the optimal wattage for the installed pod) and Variable Wattage Mode, giving you full command over your output. Further enhancing the user experience are innovative features like Child Lock, ECO Mode for battery conservation, and Party Mode for customised screen visuals. The Argus P3 maintains full compatibility with the renowned Argus Snap Cartridge series. The kit includes two refillable, top-fill 2ml pods: a 0.4ohm mesh coil pod suited for RDL (Restricted Direct-to-Lung) vaping with 50/50 or High-VG e-liquids, and a 0.7ohm mesh coil pod for a smooth MTL (Mouth-to-Lung) draw with Nic Salts or 50/50 e-liquids. Both pods feature VooPoo’s iCOSM CODE 2.0 technology and Liquid-Seal Shield for exceptional flavour consistency and enhanced leak resistance. Finished in a durable zinc alloy and leather chassis, the Argus P3 balances its advanced technology with robust build quality and practical features, including an adjustable airflow slider to fine-tune your draw. This is a versatile pod system engineered for the demanding enthusiast and the tech-savvy vaper. Explore our UK vape liquids collection and discover a delicious companion for your kit. Pod Details: DTL 0.4ohm ARGUS Snap Pod, We recommend using High VG ( Sub-Ohm) E-liquid Only MTL 0.7ohm ARGUS Snap Pod, We recommend using 50/50 , Nic Salt or High PG E-Liquid Please Note: When filling your pod with e-liquid for the first time, allow the pod to sit for ten minutes before use. This will allow the e-liquid to better saturate the wicking material, a type of cotton, to prevent dry hits and ensure the best flavour and performance from your coil.",
